Title: False Intentions, True Love
Credit: Fountain conversion with English action and source-language dialogue
Source: See SOURCE.md

# Episode 1

INT. JI RAN'S OFFICE - DAY #1-1#

Architectural plans, wood samples, a metal figurine and pour-over coffee equipment cover the desk. JI RAN, in a fitted gray shirt, pours water through a filter. She braces one hand on the desk, expression cold.

SUPER: Ji Ran, owner of Jiejian Company

SU YAQING (V.O.)
听说你爸想让你跟路少泽联姻，你当年那么爱他，怎么样是不是很开心啊？

JI RAN
开心，他死了我更开心。

INT. JI FAMILY LIVING ROOM - DAY #1-2#

FLASHBACK. Leaves sway in warm sunlight.

SUPER: Five years earlier

LU SHAOZE stands before the sofa with his head down. JI HONGYUAN, Ji Ran's father, pushes a document envelope off the table onto the carpet.

JI HONGYUAN
我已经给纪然安排好了联姻对象，是陈氏集团的公子，也给你安排了国外的学校，以后，不要再来找纪然。

He snorts.

JI HONGYUAN
嗯。

Lu Shaoze picks up the envelope and leaves. The younger Ji Ran watches from behind a marble column, fists clenched. He passes without noticing her. She slumps against the wall, struggling to breathe.

INT. JI RAN'S OFFICE - DAY #1-3#

BACK TO PRESENT. Ji Ran sips her coffee and sets it down, her gaze hardening.

JI RAN (V.O.)
五年前，纪宏远逼走路少泽，让我跟陈家联姻。现在路少泽发达了，又迫不及待悔婚，把我塞给路少泽。在他眼里，我永远都只是一个待价而沽的工具。

INT. SU YAQING'S LIVING ROOM - DAY #1-4#

SU YAQING sits on a cream sofa, video-calling Ji Ran.

SUPER: Su Yaqing, heiress of the Su family

JI RAN (V.O.)
可惜，现在的纪然，已经不会再任人摆布了。无论是路少泽也好，还是其他人也罢，我的男人，我自己选，我要。

SU YAQING
嗯？还选老公？

JI RAN (V.O.)
对，我要公开招聘面试，海选。

SU YAQING
纪然，亏你想得出来啊，你当这是选秀呢，还海选。

JI RAN (V.O.)
相亲的话效率太慢，太浪费时间，我哪有那么多时间跟那么多男人周旋，搞个集中面试效率最高喽。

SU YAQING
哎，那我弟最近刚好回国了，要不你选他，知根知底的，又听话又懂事多好。

JI RAN (V.O.)
就你那个继母家的弟弟？算了算了，豪门联姻水太深，我就算要找，也要找个普通人。

SU YAQING
你们苏家我可招惹不起。嗯也是，毕竟你父母当年闹成那样，你又被你爸当成联姻工具，然然，反正不管你做什么，我都支持你。

LIN QINGYU stands by the kitchen door holding a glass, quietly listening and smiling.

SUPER: Lin Qingyu, college student

INT. SU YAQING'S DINING AREA - DAY #1-5#

A vase of daisies and a wine bottle stand on a marble table. Lin Qingyu sits by the window, his expression turning serious as he makes a call.

LIN QINGYU
阿杰，给我准备一套最普通的大学生衣服，再帮我处理一下个人资料，从明天开始，我就是一名普通的大学生。另外，这件事，绝对不能让我姐知道。

AJIE (V.O.)
老板，您明天要出席港城的行业高峰论坛，您...

LIN QINGYU
推了，明天，我要去面试。

SUPER: To be continued

# Episode 2

INT. JI RAN'S OFFICE - DAY #2-1#

Leather seating and a marble coffee table furnish the office. A sign reads "JUST DO IT." XU BANXIA (许半夏), the secretary, approaches Ji Ran's desk.

SUPER: Xu Banxia, secretary

XU BANXIA
纪总，候选人都已经到了。

Ji Ran looks at the four men lined up before her.

JI RAN
身高？

GREEN-SHIRT APPLICANT
一米七九。

JI RAN
体重？

BLUE-TANK-TOP APPLICANT
七十五公斤。

JI RAN
有腹肌？

GRAY-SHIRT APPLICANT
八块。

Ji Ran suppresses a smile.

JI RAN
能干吗？

APPLICANTS
啊？呃能能能。

JI RAN
来吧，展示。

The green-shirt applicant struggles theatrically with a small dumbbell.

GREEN-SHIRT APPLICANT
唔。

The man in the blue tank top throws an awkward punch.

BLUE-TANK-TOP APPLICANT
嚯。

The gray-shirt applicant wrestles his shirt up to expose his stomach. The fourth man removes his top, flexes and licks his lips.

SHIRTLESS APPLICANT
啊~yeah。

Ji Ran grips her chair arms, then covers her forehead.

JI RAN
哎。

Xu Banxia hides her face in embarrassment.

XU BANXIA
老板，最后一个人迟到了，咱们。

JI RAN
哎呦，不看了不看了，再看眼睛就要瞎了。

XU BANXIA
嗯。

Ji Ran rises and heads for the door. Lin Qingyu, the final applicant Xu Banxia has been waiting for, braces himself against the doorframe in denim, sweating and panting.

LIN QINGYU
抱歉，我来晚了。

INT. JI RAN'S OFFICE - DAY #2-2#

Soft points of light drift across the image.

SUPER: To be continued

# Episode 3

INT. JI RAN'S OFFICE - DAY #3-1#

Lin Qingyu, the applicant who arrived late, stands at the door, soaked and breathless.

LIN QINGYU
抱歉，我来晚了。
没想到今天下这么大雨，我自行车链子掉了，一路跑过来的。

JI RAN (V.O.)
脸长得好，身材也不错，带出去够有面。

Xu Banxia suppresses a laugh and leaves, closing the door. Ji Ran folds her arms and walks around Lin Qingyu, inspecting him. She pokes his stomach through his white T-shirt. He stands awkwardly, sweat beading on his forehead.

A cartoon bouncing sound accompanies each poke.

JI RAN
一、二、三、四。
你叫什么名字？

LIN QINGYU
林、林青羽。

JI RAN
嗯，身高？

LIN QINGYU
一米八六。

JI RAN
体重？

LIN QINGYU
六十四公斤。

JI RAN
年龄？

LIN QINGYU
二十一。

Ji Ran sighs, disappointed.

JI RAN
未到法定婚龄，出门左拐不送。

LIN QINGYU
啊？

The image softens into drifting light.

SUPER: To be continued

# Episode 4

INT. JI RAN'S APARTMENT ENTRANCE - NIGHT #4-1#

Lu Shaoze straightens his hair and knocks on the door. The elevator opens behind him. He startles and collides with Ji Ran as she steps out carrying a black handbag. They stop in the entrance hall beneath an autumn landscape painting.

LU SHAOZE
呀，好久不见呀，纪大小姐，您真是贵人事多，这么晚才回家呀。

JI RAN
比不上路少爷您清闲，都有空在别人家门口当门神了。怎么，路少爷这是刚回国，都找不到自己家门口在哪了？

LU SHAOZE
嘿，听说你跟陈家那婚事黄了，是你踢的人家，还是你爸觉得陈家不够格，又把人家给甩了？

Ji Ran tightens her grip on her bag. Her eyes redden, but she holds her anger in.

JI RAN
他怎么样你会不知道吗？我爸现在眼中最理想的乘龙快婿不就是你吗，路少爷。可惜啊，让你失望了，我现在有男朋友了，感情很稳定，正准备结婚。

LU SHAOZE
男朋友？结婚？纪然，你觉得你这借口谁能信的过？就你爸那种人，今天觉得陈家是块肥肉，就敢让你跟人家订婚，明天觉得陆家有价值，就敢撕毁婚约，你去问问，整个锦城，有谁家敢跟你们家联姻呀，啊？也就是本少我，堂堂路氏集团的继承人，有的是资金和底气，接得住你爸这种大麻烦，也不怕你这种小麻烦，你说，对吧？哼。

He reaches for her shoulder. Lin Qingyu steps beside Ji Ran, puts a protective arm around her waist and faces him.

LIN QINGYU
姐姐，我们回家吧，我都饿了。

Soft light and drifting flakes fill the image.

SUPER: To be continued

# Episode 5

INT. APARTMENT CORRIDOR - NIGHT #5-1#

Lin Qingyu holds a grocery bag full of greens. Lu Shaoze stares at his arm around Ji Ran.

LU SHAOZE
你谁啊，手拿开。

Lin Qingyu smiles and offers his right hand.

LIN QINGYU
哟，你好。我是纪然男朋友，林青羽。
哎呀姐姐也真是的，有客人来了，怎么不让进家门呢，站在门口说话呢。

LU SHAOZE
纪然，我才是你的联姻对象，旁边这男的怎么回事啊？

JI RAN
我不都跟你说了吗，我已经有男朋友了，正准备结婚。

LU SHAOZE
不可能！我们在一块四年，你那么爱我，怎么可能跟别人在一块？

JI RAN
可我就是跟别人在一起了，怎么？你咬我啊？

LIN QINGYU
我看你脸色不太好，是不是身体哪里不舒服呀，您年纪也不小了，要多注意身体，才行呀。

Lin Qingyu pats his shoulder. Lu Shaoze knocks his hand away and points furiously at them, unable to speak. He storms off. Ji Ran and Lin Qingyu exchange a look. Lin Qingyu grins as playful music rises.

EXT. CITY ARTERIAL ROAD - NIGHT #5-2#

Dusk. Headlights pack the road between office towers. Streetlights come on as the sky darkens.

INT. JI RAN'S LIVING ROOM - NIGHT #5-3#

SUPER: Ji Ran's home

A marble-and-glass coffee table, patterned rug and open kitchen surround a pale sofa. Lin Qingyu sits on it. Ji Ran stands opposite him, arms folded.

JI RAN
你面试都没通过，这次来想干嘛？

Lin Qingyu sits up and meets her eyes.

LIN QINGYU
我来争取一个试用期。

Soft light and snowlike flecks drift across the image.

SUPER: To be continued
